The items in the `Multi<String>` hit a condition in [`JacksonMessageBodyWriterUtil`](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/4a057ec392f4e7e4f0733a61d52a5151bbd1896a/extensions/resteasy-reactive/quarkus-resteasy-reactive-jackson-common/runtime/src/main/java/io/quarkus/resteasy/reactive/jackson/runtime/serialisers/JacksonMessageBodyWriterUtil.java#L47):

```java
if (o instanceof String) { // YUK: done in order to avoid adding extra quotes...
    entityStream.write(((String) o).getBytes());
} else {
    ...
```

Removing the condition would fix this issue but I'm not sure if it would raise other issues.
